@PaymentsModule_HostAddress = http://localhost:5150
@Token = <JWT from the identity provider>

### Open cash shift (201 Created / 409 Conflict if already open)
POST {{PaymentsModule_HostAddress}}/api/v1/cash-shifts/open
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fondo_inicial": 500.00
}

### Close cash shift (200 OK / 422 Unprocessable Entity if no open shift)
POST {{PaymentsModule_HostAddress}}/api/v1/cash-shifts/close
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "efectivo_declarado": 2500.00
}

### Ticket detail by folio
GET {{PaymentsModule_HostAddress}}/api/v1/pagos/TX-20260901-000001
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### Sales history (paged, filters are optional)
GET {{PaymentsModule_HostAddress}}/api/v1/pagos?fecha_inicio=2026-09-01T00:00:00Z&fecha_fin=2026-09-30T23:59:59Z&estado=COMPLETADO&page_index=1&page_size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

